            "sid": "LEV 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Stand up in the presence of the aged, show respect for the elderly and revere your God. I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.19.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.19.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'When a foreigner resides among you in your land, do not mistreat them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The foreigner residing among you must be treated as your native-born. Love them as yourself, for you were foreigners in Egypt. I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.19.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Do not use dishonest standards when measuring length, weight or quantity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Use honest scales and honest weights, an honest ephah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and an honest hin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.19.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, who brought you out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
